---
title: Requests
description: Track request queue for users to submit missing music for scraper ingestion.
section: Requests
order: 8
method: GET
endpoint: /requests
---

## List Song Requests

```http
GET /requests?status=pending
```

### Headers

- `x-api-key`: `<your_client_api_key>` (or `Authorization: Bearer <key>`)

### Response (`200 OK`)

```json
[
  {
    "id": "req_1a2b3c",
    "query": "Pamungkas - To the Bone",
    "status": "pending",
    "metadata": "{\"requested_by\": \"user_456\"}",
    "created_at": "2024-03-20T14:15:00Z"
  }
]
```

---

## Submit Song Request

```http
POST /requests
```

### Request Body

```json
{
  "query": "Feast - Peradaban"
}
```

### Response (`201 Created`)

```json
{
  "id": "req_9f8e7d",
  "query": "Feast - Peradaban",
  "status": "pending",
  "created_at": "2024-03-20T14:20:00Z"
}
```
